<title>USA: Uniholding proposes IPO on Swiss exchange.</title>
<headline>Uniholding proposes IPO on Swiss exchange.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>UniHolding Corp said its majority-owned Swiss unit, Unilabs S.A., has retained bankers in connection with a proposed initial public offering in Switzerland that may lead to a listing on the Swiss Stock Exchange during the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The proposed IPO is to be led by Union Bank of Switzerland, the largest Swiss bank.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
